(7385159, 1159239, 49109, '<td valign="top">uninteresting, dull shot</td>', 'uninteresting, dull shot', '2015-07-10 06:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385161, 1159183, 49109, '<td valign="top">Maybe being pedantic here, but, as beautiful this shot is, it doesn''t meet the challenge IMO; I''d rather say the subject is a woman covered with fabric - as opposed to a woman seen through fabric or behind fabric. Other than that you found a great color scheme, the bg works excellently. Only nitpick would be that the right part of the fabric looks like it''s held by a string and gives the impression of the woman having something on her back or of a second person sitting behind her - slightly awkward. That said, I can only give you my highest vote for a DNMC image.</td>', 'Maybe being pedantic here, but, as beautiful this shot is, it doesn''t meet the challenge IMO; I''d rather say the subject is a woman covered with fabric - as opposed to a woman seen through fabric or behind fabric. Other than that you found a great color scheme, the bg works excellently. Only nitpick would be that the right part of the fabric looks like it''s held by a string and gives the impression of the woman having something on her back or of a second person sitting behind her - slightly awkward. That said, I can only give you my highest vote for a DNMC image.', '2015-07-10 06:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385162, 1159125, 49109, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and well composed, not in the spirit of the challenge, though; IMO the subject is a woman with umbrella walking through lavender fields - there''s nothing (semi-)transparent between you and the subject (except for the lens of course)</td>', 'Beautiful colors and well composed, not in the spirit of the challenge, though; IMO the subject is a woman with umbrella walking through lavender fields - there''s nothing (semi-)transparent between you and the subject (except for the lens of course)', '2015-07-10 06:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385163, 1159397, 49109, '<td valign="top">I understand why you''re wearing cotton gloves, it makes the shot less appealing, though</td>', 'I understand why you''re wearing cotton gloves, it makes the shot less appealing, though', '2015-07-10 06:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385165, 1159100, 49109, '<td valign="top">that one looks dead</td>', 'that one looks dead', '2015-07-10 06:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385178, 1159647, 58667, '<td valign="top">This is great! I feel the saturation is just a little much.</td>', 'This is great! I feel the saturation is just a little much.', '2015-07-10 08:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385181, 1159625, 58667, '<td valign="top">*wash cycle? ;)<br/> <br/>I''m in two minds about this. On the one hand I like the clarity and colours, but on the other hand, I''m not sure this is something I''d really like to look at. And it also doesn''t give <strike>any</strike> enough context as to what it really is.</td>', '*wash cycle? ;) I''m in two minds about this. On the one hand I like the clarity and colours, but on the other hand, I''m not sure this is something I''d really like to look at. And it also doesn''t give any enough context as to what it really is.', '2015-07-10 08:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385182, 1159626, 58667, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the glass are so important here.</td>', 'The reflections on the glass are so important here.', '2015-07-10 08:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385183, 1159257, 58667, '<td valign="top">A few things (I might be wrong on all or none): It doesn''t look crisp and sharp at all, which I value in a photo like this. It''s also very underexposed (and I''m not sure why?). The obvious reflection is very distracting (you could try using a polarizer to minimize reflections). And then it''s not all that interesting - just centered, like you''re trying to sell it. Try different focal lengths to compress or distort the subject, and try to use a much smaller aperture to increase your DOF (and possibly maximize sharpness). If you photo''d this in a soft box, the transparency might be much more obvious, bringing out the detail inside the ball.</td>', 'A few things (I might be wrong on all or none): It doesn''t look crisp and sharp at all, which I value in a photo like this. It''s also very underexposed (and I''m not sure why?). The obvious reflection is very distracting (you could try using a polarizer to minimize reflections). And then it''s not all that interesting - just centered, like you''re trying to sell it. Try different focal lengths to compress or distort the subject, and try to use a much smaller aperture to increase your DOF (and possibly maximize sharpness). If you photo''d this in a soft box, the transparency might be much more obvious, bringing out the detail inside the ball.', '2015-07-10 08:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385184, 1159526, 58667, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if focusing across the street would be better? And I''m not really sure about what this is portraying.</td>', 'I''m not sure if focusing across the street would be better? And I''m not really sure about what this is portraying.', '2015-07-10 08:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385186, 1159302, 58667, '<td valign="top">Yep.</td>', 'Yep.', '2015-07-10 08:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385197, 1159183, 46177, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning I love the colour palette and the flow of the material over the model. The only 10 of the challenge my number 1 pick.</td>', 'Simply stunning I love the colour palette and the flow of the material over the model. The only 10 of the challenge my number 1 pick.', '2015-07-10 08:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
