(7385391, 1159183, 16106, '<td valign="top">I really like this image but I have no idea what the transparency is supposed to be. Is it the fabric, or are we looking through something as well? Any way it is a fine image, but I will have to come back to score it.</td>', 'I really like this image but I have no idea what the transparency is supposed to be. Is it the fabric, or are we looking through something as well? Any way it is a fine image, but I will have to come back to score it.', '2015-07-10 21:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385394, 1159075, 16106, '<td valign="top">One of the best. A lovely play of hands.</td>', 'One of the best. A lovely play of hands.', '2015-07-10 21:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385397, 1159397, 16106, '<td valign="top">The glove distracts from a good image. I ought to be looking at the dog and the green, but I keep being drawn to the highlights of the glove and it''s reflection in the globe, and wondering why? Fear of fingerprints? Is it much colder out than it looks? it doesn''t help that there is another similar image in the challenge where the hand holding it creates none of these distractions. I know it is unfair to compare similar images in a challenge since the authors had no idea what else would be submitted.....but I can''t help myself.</td>', 'The glove distracts from a good image. I ought to be looking at the dog and the green, but I keep being drawn to the highlights of the glove and it''s reflection in the globe, and wondering why? Fear of fingerprints? Is it much colder out than it looks? it doesn''t help that there is another similar image in the challenge where the hand holding it creates none of these distractions. I know it is unfair to compare similar images in a challenge since the authors had no idea what else would be submitted.....but I can''t help myself.', '2015-07-10 21:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385399, 1159639, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF and B&amp;W to make a simple idea shine. top 3</td>', 'Nice use of DOF and B&W to make a simple idea shine. top 3', '2015-07-10 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
