(7385742, 1159183, 35804, '<td valign="top">The movement of the fabric is so beautiful, the hint of a face and the light...but the processing is so <i>heavy</i>, the texture so cumbersome, and I say this as someone who likes using textures and overlays. This would be so beautiful with out so much going on around and over the subject.</td>', 'The movement of the fabric is so beautiful, the hint of a face and the light...but the processing is so heavy, the texture so cumbersome, and I say this as someone who likes using textures and overlays. This would be so beautiful with out so much going on around and over the subject.', '2015-07-12 14:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
