(7386498, 1159559, 86447, '<td valign="top">Interesting image... I can''t decide if I like it...  Ha!<br/> <br/>It''s not anything I''d like to put on my wall (but neither are most of my images)... but I could see this in an art gallery.</td>', 'Interesting image... I can''t decide if I like it...  Ha! It''s not anything I''d like to put on my wall (but neither are most of my images)... but I could see this in an art gallery.', '2015-07-13 17:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
