(7388334, 1159525, 97225, '<td valign="top">Gosh! Congratulations on your hat trick of blues! Nice work. <br/> <br/>Did you get burnt holding that ball? I tried it once and it burnt pretty quickly. Then I put it down on a wooden table and that started to smoke and char, very quickly. I make sure I don''t leave it anywhere in the house where the sun can reach it.</td>', 'Gosh! Congratulations on your hat trick of blues! Nice work.  Did you get burnt holding that ball? I tried it once and it burnt pretty quickly. Then I put it down on a wooden table and that started to smoke and char, very quickly. I make sure I don''t leave it anywhere in the house where the sun can reach it.', '2015-07-17 02:32:29.000000', NULL, 0),
