(7388453, 1159155, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>You have good lighting. I like how the shot is frozen. However, your subject is almost non-existing. The wall of water really obscures the subject and takes away from the impact of the shot. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... You have good lighting. I like how the shot is frozen. However, your subject is almost non-existing. The wall of water really obscures the subject and takes away from the impact of the shot. Happy shooting', '2015-07-17 11:16:53.000000', NULL, 0),
