(7388811, 1159525, 49954, '<td valign="top">Congrats on three blue in a row.  Remarkable honor for a remarkable set of photos.</td>', 'Congrats on three blue in a row.  Remarkable honor for a remarkable set of photos.', '2015-07-18 10:25:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7388842, 1159100, 180932, '<td valign="top">fantastic :)</td>', 'fantastic :)', '2015-07-18 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7388910, 1159517, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top5 finish! You have eyes of a hawk. The slant(or rather distortion of the pattern) is almost undetectable. Depending on how you look at it, a bit ore pronounced on the left side but who votes with a protractor? ;) When lazy I size down the browser window and judge it against the scrollbar line.</td>', 'Congrats on the top5 finish! You have eyes of a hawk. The slant(or rather distortion of the pattern) is almost undetectable. Depending on how you look at it, a bit ore pronounced on the left side but who votes with a protractor? ;) When lazy I size down the browser window and judge it against the scrollbar line.', '2015-07-18 15:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7388911, 1159075, 29011, '<td valign="top">So glad this placed well. Congrats on this emotive capture.</td>', 'So glad this placed well. Congrats on this emotive capture.', '2015-07-18 15:02:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7389057, 1159183, 25190, '<td valign="top">Great take on the Challenge judi and front page fantastic love the effect of the shroud model and giving that transparency great lighting and color blend.Gord</td>', 'Great take on the Challenge judi and front page fantastic love the effect of the shroud model and giving that transparency great lighting and color blend.Gord', '2015-07-19 00:01:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7391803, 1159614, 25024, '<td valign="top">*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club*<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>The lovely soft focus and pastel shades work really well together here to produce an image that has an air of mystery about it. Your composition adds impact to the end result together with the subtle shift in tones from the dark base to the lighter top makes a great end result.<br/> <br/>There''s nothing I would alter here it is a lovely end result that has been well appreciated by your commenters with whom I concur, Sid.</td>', '*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club* An appealing image that meets the challenge well. The lovely soft focus and pastel shades work really well together here to produce an image that has an air of mystery about it. Your composition adds impact to the end result together with the subtle shift in tones from the dark base to the lighter top makes a great end result. There''s nothing I would alter here it is a lovely end result that has been well appreciated by your commenters with whom I concur, Sid.', '2015-07-24 08:01:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7391925, 1159647, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Interesting take on this challenge, It did quite well in voting too. The color of the water is great I love that deep blue color contrasted with the brown on the frog. That just works for me. I think your crop is a bit too tight on the left. It almost seems to be crowding his webbed foot a bit. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Interesting take on this challenge, It did quite well in voting too. The color of the water is great I love that deep blue color contrasted with the brown on the frog. That just works for me. I think your crop is a bit too tight on the left. It almost seems to be crowding his webbed foot a bit. Happy shooting', '2015-07-24 15:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7404131, 1159661, 113591, '<td valign="top">Out of left field.<br/></td>', 'Out of left field.', '2015-09-11 10:42:56.000000', NULL, 0),
